{"4674310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Airport Mania: First Flight", "steam_appid": 4674310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pack your bags for an exciting trip as you take to the skies and journey from airport to airport, helping customers along the way! <i>Airport Mania: First Flight</i> is a fast-paced time-management game that will put your multitasking skills to the test. Each of the eight locations you'll fly to features unique challenges and a cast of whimsical, charming planes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct incoming flights to the runway, guide them to their gates, unload passengers, and clear them for takeoff before time runs out. Upgrade your airport along the way with larger terminals, painting spaces, and in-flight movies to keep your customers happy. Can you master the art of air traffic control, rack up high scores, and avoid any flight delays?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to 8 Amusing Airports!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 84 Delightful Levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your own Airport!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure to put a smile on your face!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pack your bags for an exciting trip as you take to the skies and journey from airport to airport, helping customers along the way! <i>Airport Mania: First Flight</i> is a fast-paced time-management game that will put your multitasking skills to the test. Each of the eight locations you'll fly to features unique challenges and a cast of whimsical, charming planes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Direct incoming flights to the runway, guide them to their gates, unload passengers, and clear them for takeoff before time runs out. Upgrade your airport along the way with larger terminals, painting spaces, and in-flight movies to keep your customers happy. Can you master the art of air traffic control, rack up high scores, and avoid any flight delays?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to 8 Amusing Airports!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy 84 Delightful Levels!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your own Airport!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sure to put a smile on your face!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Take control of the skies in this fast-paced time management game. Direct cute airplanes to runways, guide them to gates for boarding, and clear them for takeoff to earn high scores. Upgrade your airport facilities, manage chaotic traffic, and keep your cartoon fleet flying on schedule!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Swedish, Simplified Chinese, Dutch, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America", "reviews": "“Time-management fun for aspiring air traffic controllers.”<br>4/5 – Common Sense Media <br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674310/36787716e24508b3b8d06ea99582dc0bcae24cf5/header.jpg?t=1780661767", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674310/c710303dd6494f18f8f4b4b5e8dab5741f56c3d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780661767", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674310/c710303dd6494f18f8f4b4b5e8dab5741f56c3d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780661767", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1 gigahertz (GHz) or faster processor or SoC.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL compatible graphics card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_re